## Third-party material

**Dependencies.** The site is built with Astro and Starlight, the app with Capacitor; those and
every other npm/CocoaPods dependency are licensed by their own authors under their own terms, and
nothing above changes that. See the respective lockfiles.

**Quoted material.** Where a page quotes or embeds material owned by someone else — a statute, a
standard, an organization's own wording — that material stays under its own terms and is not
relicensed here.

**Logos and names.** Trademarks, ours and other organizations', are not covered. These licenses
cover writing and code, not marks.

